        "type": "text/html",
        "value": "<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><em>Want to stay on top of the science and politics driving biotech today?&#xa0;<a href=\"https://www.statnews.com/signup/readout/\">Sign up</a>&#xa0;to get our biotech newsletter in your inbox.</em></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Good morning. We&#x2019;ve got lots of news that we&#x2019;ll get straight into.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-the-need-to-know-this-morning\">The need-to-know this morning</h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Beam Therapeutics</strong> said its CRISPR-based treatment for sickle cell disease <a href=\"https://investors.beamtx.com/news-releases/news-release-details/beam-therapeutics-announces-positive-topline-pivotal-data-beacon\" rel=\"noopener\">achieved the primary goal</a>&#xa0;of a pivotal clinical trial &#x2014; freedom from severe pain crises for at least 12 months. No detailed data were disclosed, but Beam said it would file an FDA marketing application for the therapy, called risto-cel, as soon as&#xa0;the end of this year.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-pepgen-shows-nbsp-promising-data-for-muscular-dystrophy-nbsp\">PepGen shows&#xa0;promising data for muscular dystrophy&#xa0;</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The biotech company PepGen said this morning that its experimental drug had shown, by one key measure, the most promising early data yet in the race to treat a commmon type of muscular dystrophy.</p><p><a href=\"https://www.statnews.com/2026/11/10/biotech-news-glp-1-given-an-fda-warning-for-rare-eye-condition-risk/?utm_campaign=rss\">Continue to STAT+ to read the full story&hellip;</a></p>"
      }
